      "title": "Sweet Bean Paste by Durian Sukegawa | Goodreads",
      "snippet": "An elderly woman with disfigured hands and a troubled past, she makes the best sweet bean paste Sentaro has ever tasted. The unlikeliest of friendships blossoms, but it will take all of their resolve - and plenty of pancakes - to protect themselves when Tokue's dark secret comes to light.",
